return {
    ["\n　　让我猜猜……你肯定在想'这些牌到底怎么走'对不对？    \n　　放心，就算你不懂扑克，我也不会嘲笑你~\n 　　作为一个负责的主持人，我还是准备了这本宝典——《傻瓜都能懂的牌经》！\n\n 　　所谓<Letter_Highlight>顺子</>，就是连续的5个数字，比如：4-5-6-7-8。\n 　　明白了吗？必须一个跟一个，不能跳着来！也<Letter_Highlight>不能反悔！</>\n\n 　　花色？在这里，爱情不分种族~红心、黑桃、方块、梅花，混着来都行！\n 　　重要的只有<Letter_Highlight>数字顺序</>，记住了吗？\n\n 　　如果你踩错了……嘻嘻，你会摔下去，摔下去，再摔下去！\n\n 　　——爱你的解说员，小丑 敬上"] = "\n	Let me guess... you must be thinking 'how do these cards even work', right?    \n	Don't worry, even if you don't understand poker, I won't laugh at you~\n 	As a responsible host, I have prepared this treasure book—\"The Card Sutra Even a Fool Can Understand\"!\n\n 	A so-called <Letter_Highlight>Straight</> is 5 consecutive numbers, for example: 4-5-6-7-8.\n 	Understand? They must be one after another, you can't skip! And you <Letter_Highlight>cannot take it back!</>\n\n 	Suits? Here, love knows no race~ Hearts, Spades, Diamonds, Clubs, mixing them is fine!\n 	The only thing that matters is the <Letter_Highlight>numerical order</>, got it?\n\n 	If you step wrong... hehe, you will fall down, fall down, and fall down again!\n\n 	—Yours truly, the commentator, Clown",
